      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- User should be able to view a list of coding problems\n- User should be able to view a coding problem, code a \n  sol in multiple languages.\n- User should be able to submit their sol and get instant feedback\n- User should be able to view a live leaderboard of competitions",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- User should be able to view a list of coding problems\n- User should be able to view a coding problem, code a \n  sol in multiple languages.\n- User should be able to submit their sol and get instant feedback\n- User should be able to view a live leaderboard of competitions",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
