      "updated": 1783238003025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non Functional Requirements\n- Availability >> Consistency\n- System should support security and isloation when running user code.\n- System should submission result within 5 seconds.\n- System should support competitions with over 100k users",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non Functional Requirements\n- Availability >> Consistency\n- System should support security and isloation when running user code.\n- System should submission result within 5 seconds.\n- System should support competitions with over 100k users",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "u1faDvvpwkfrPIlmWIJLb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1687.3581217188853,
