    },
    {
      "id": "08vhSzq20FDsbD6er1iwh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3485.747701767877,
      "y": 7982.083847934136,
      "width": 1546.3272705078125,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1133863938,
      "version": 41,
      "versionNonce": 981213879,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783252488777,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) Users should be able to view a given problem and code a solution\n- To view a problem, the client will make a request to the API server with GET /problems/:id and the server will \n  return the full problem statement and code stub after fetching it from the database.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) Users should be able to view a given problem and code a solution\n- To view a problem, the client will make a request to the API server with GET /problems/:id and the server will \n  return the full problem statement and code stub after fetching it from the database.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "p1pxhopPgSisTiwZG8Q7w",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3489.9316939270134,
      "y": 8145.93533103894,
      "width": 1618.259033203125,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1067605278,
      "version": 495,
      "versionNonce": 1651815383,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783252488777,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3) Users should be able to submit their solution and get instant feedback\nBad Sol: Running code in api server\n- User can submit malicious code, or code which has memory leaks, running Code is cpu intensive, it can bring down your\n  server and with other no othe request to be processed.\n\nGood Sol: Running Code in Virtual Machine (VM)\n- VMs are resource intensive, can be slow to start up.\n- Need to ensure we are not running out of resources / leaving VMs running when not needed.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3) Users should be able to submit their solution and get instant feedback\nBad Sol: Running code in api server\n- User can submit malicious code, or code which has memory leaks, running Code is cpu intensive, it can bring down your\n  server and with other no othe request to be processed.\n\nGood Sol: Running Code in Virtual Machine (VM)\n- VMs are resource intensive, can be slow to start up.\n- Need to ensure we are not running out of resources / leaving VMs running when not needed.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HRvtJJ6yUBm-8GWfh626n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3496.0856422507177,
      "y": 8480.286787700054,
      "width": 1987.0745849609375,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1322808094,
      "version": 330,
      "versionNonce": 1534992631,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783252488778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Great Sol: Run Code inside a Container\n- Containers, on the other hand, share the host system's kernel and isolate the application processes from each other. \n  They include the application and its dependencies (libraries, binaries) but not a full OS, making them lightweight and enabling faster start times\n- We can create container for each runtime we support and run code in a sandboxed environment.\nChallenge: Properly configure and secure container to prevent users from breaking out of container & accessing the host system.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Great Sol: Run Code inside a Container\n- Containers, on the other hand, share the host system's kernel and isolate the application processes from each other. \n  They include the application and its dependencies (libraries, binaries) but not a full OS, making them lightweight and enabling faster start times\n- We can create container for each runtime we support and run code in a sandboxed environment.\nChallenge: Properly configure and secure container to prevent users from breaking out of container & accessing the host system.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "J7PkTmWlLdE6LqsBUrKVW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3477.1092716788517,
      "y": 9692.824893773051,
      "width": 2103.38671875,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1193375070,
      "version": 265,
      "versionNonce": 119335447,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783252488778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Great Sol: Run Code in Serverless Function\n- Serverless Function (AWS) : Serverless functions are small, stateless, event-driven functions that run in response to triggers (e.g. an HTTP request). \n                                    They are managed by a cloud provider and automatically scale up or down based on demand, making them a great option for \n                                     running code that is CPU intensive or unpredictable in terms of load.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Great Sol: Run Code in Serverless Function\n- Serverless Function (AWS) : Serverless functions are small, stateless, event-driven functions that run in response to triggers (e.g. an HTTP request). \n                                    They are managed by a cloud provider and automatically scale up or down based on demand, making them a great option for \n                                     running code that is CPU intensive or unpredictable in terms of load.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "u45EhMlbToOflv1KrmjOe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3492.5489003901885,
      "y": 9905.6861904846,
      "width": 1777.634765625,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBx",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 233207454,
      "version": 181,
      "versionNonce": 574983991,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783252488778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Challenge:\n- Serverless functions have a cold start time, which can introduce latency for the first request to a function. \n Additionally, serverless functions have resource limits that can impact the performance of long running or resource intensive code",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Challenge:\n- Serverless functions have a cold start time, which can introduce latency for the first request to a function. \n Additionally, serverless functions have resource limits that can impact the performance of long running or resource intensive code",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
