      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783252488778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) How will the system support isolation and security when running user code?",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) How will the system support isolation and security when running user code?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gXH-ExXfxDo9mYxgH_zqI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6420.720577879673,
      "y": 6918.182077084399,
      "width": 331.2678527832031,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCc",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 197711518,
      "version": 53,
      "versionNonce": 1270074903,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783252488778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Read Only Filesystem:",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Read Only Filesystem:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8CFk3oXuBBJdhVO4cfQ53",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6767.30350334198,
      "y": 6917.725546337358,
      "width": 1612.21142578125,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCd",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2013741314,
      "version": 103,
      "versionNonce": 2053108535,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783252488778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "To prevent users from writing to the filesystem, we can mount the code directory as read-only and write any output \n to a temporary directory that is deleted a short time after completion",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "To prevent users from writing to the filesystem, we can mount the code directory as read-only and write any output \n to a temporary directory that is deleted a short time after completion",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5D7_oLeDW1VmWWHUx-lyj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6415.651508378173,
      "y": 7052.741056208607,
      "width": 379.59588623046875,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCe",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1647596062,
      "version": 83,
      "versionNonce": 109737047,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783252488778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) CPU and Memory Bounds",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) CPU and Memory Bounds",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3UsejRpjsGiP95uKZJDoM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6420.025013297557,
      "y": 7119.622810650181,
      "width": 283.1078186035156,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 438682498,
      "version": 134,
      "versionNonce": 1745342839,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783252488778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3) Explicit Timeout :",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3) Explicit Timeout :",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3QgXvJbNT-OdkRpjKks5Q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6717.048962574334,
      "y": 7121.574132630415,
      "width": 1660.0250305614475,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1756515650,
      "version": 156,
      "versionNonce": 672959127,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783252488778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "To prevent users from running infinite loops, we can wrap the user's code in a timeout that kills the process if it runs\nfor longer than a predefined time limit, say 5 seconds",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "To prevent users from running infinite loops, we can wrap the user's code in a timeout that kills the process if it runs for longer than a predefined time limit, say 5 seconds",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "v6rvLoqOD73OQEhRK_dvf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6419.095899739737,
      "y": 7226.8176134820205,
      "width": 1917.1309814453125,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 450602690,
      "version": 231,
      "versionNonce": 863838135,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783252488778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4) Limit Network Access : Can use AWS vpcs security group and nacls to restrict al outbound and inboun traffic except essential conenction",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4) Limit Network Access : Can use AWS vpcs security group and nacls to restrict al outbound and inboun traffic except essential conenction",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8dXRGUQPk1qjuhNSyVXxK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6420.372823615957,
      "y": 7289.093248264507,
      "width": 1939.035137742563,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCi",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 664354846,
      "version": 154,
      "versionNonce": 1817055447,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783252488778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5) No System Calls (Seccomp): We don't want users to be able to make system calls that could compromise the host system",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5) No System Calls (Seccomp): We don't want users to be able to make system calls that could compromise the host system",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0r8_d41DFQlsVmboe4ewS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6354.7726363297725,
      "y": 7433.480782108655,
      "width": 873.9356689453125,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1006432990,
      "version": 153,
      "versionNonce": 2082725367,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783252488778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) How would you make fetching the leaderboard more efficient?\n    - Caching with Periodic updates\n    - Redis sorted set with periodic polling\n\n      ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) How would you make fetching the leaderboard more efficient?\n    - Caching with Periodic updates\n    - Redis sorted set with periodic polling\n\n      ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oEzEUK6a9i7OQZcP1yL2L",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6415.215189879906,
      "y": 7564.082459751244,
      "width": 1538.1683790459845,
      "height": 630,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1486918585,
      "version": 216,
      "versionNonce": 1711474455,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783252488778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Real-time leaderboard using Redis sorted sets, with submission results persisted separately in the main\ndatabase.\n\nHow it works: \n - On each submission, write to the DB and ZADD competition:leaderboard:{competitionId} {score} {userId}.  -\n- Clients poll GET /competitions/:competitionId/leaderboard?top=100 every 5 seconds; the server serves\nresults straight from Redis via \nZRANGE competition:leaderboard:{competitionId} 0 N-1 REV WITHSCORES — no DB queries needed. \n\n- Initial load sends the top ~1,000 entries; further pages are fetched on demand as the user scrolls/paginates.\n\nWhy it works: \n- Sorted sets keep members ordered by score with O(log N) updates and fast range queries, making top-N\nretrieval and ranking cheap even under frequent writes.\n\nBenefits: \n- Simpler than WebSockets, near-real-time (5s is fine for this use case), minimal DB load, and scales comfortably\npolling interval can be tuned further if needed.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Real-time leaderboard using Redis sorted sets, with submission results persisted separately in the main database.\n\nHow it works: \n - On each submission, write to the DB and ZADD competition:leaderboard:{competitionId} {score} {userId}.  - - Clients poll GET /competitions/:competitionId/leaderboard?top=100 every 5 seconds; the server serves results straight from Redis via \nZRANGE competition:leaderboard:{competitionId} 0 N-1 REV WITHSCORES — no DB queries needed. \n\n- Initial load sends the top ~1,000 entries; further pages are fetched on demand as the user scrolls/paginates.\n\nWhy it works: \n- Sorted sets keep members ordered by score with O(log N) updates and fast range queries, making top-N retrieval and ranking cheap even under frequent writes.\n\nBenefits: \n- Simpler than WebSockets, near-real-time (5s is fine for this use case), minimal DB load, and scales comfortably     polling interval can be tuned further if needed.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sFXN4uxuRIMdMXPsPq-o3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6356.9930358722,
      "y": 8279.231659533083,
      "width": 1048.459716796875,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1691917401,
      "version": 61,
      "versionNonce": 1482689591,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783252488778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3) How would the system scale to support competitions with 100,000 users?",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3) How would the system scale to support competitions with 100,000 users?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yYn3amUilQ4XjPUXoP1rT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6421.291845671875,
      "y": 8331.09709669187,
      "width": 1302.9515380859375,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 689528183,
      "version": 115,
      "versionNonce": 1059024215,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783252488778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Good Sol: Dynamic Horizontal Scaling\n  We can horizontally scale each of the language specific containers to handle more submissions\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Good Sol: Dynamic Horizontal Scaling\n  We can horizontally scale each of the language specific containers to handle more submissions\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "b3PyOp7e7iE3qdPn63OJB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6407.772143240526,
      "y": 8455.738454898075,
      "width": 1436.2872314453125,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCs",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1245084313,
      "version": 111,
      "versionNonce": 362130039,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783252488778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Great Sol: Horizontal Scaling w/ Queue\n  - Allow us to buffer submissions during peak times and ensure that we don't overwhelm the containers. \n  - We can use a managed queue service like SQS to handle this for us.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Great Sol: Horizontal Scaling w/ Queue\n  - Allow us to buffer submissions during peak times and ensure that we don't overwhelm the containers. \n  - We can use a managed queue service like SQS to handle this for us.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LEDQQly1B5CgwmiZ7Gye8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6428.562583653466,
      "y": 8573.391768323656,
      "width": 1469.2722715462437,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2043484119,
      "version": 170,
      "versionNonce": 2022130583,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783252488778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Introduction of the queue has made the system asynchronous. \n This means that the API server will no longer be able to return the results of the submission immediately.\n- Instead, the user will need to poll the server for the results. We introduce a new endpoint, say \n  GET /check/:id, that is polled every second by the client to check if the submission has been processed.\n\nIt simply looks up the submission in the database and returns the results if they are available",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Introduction of the queue has made the system asynchronous. \n This means that the API server will no longer be able to return the results of the submission immediately. \n- Instead, the user will need to poll the server for the results. We introduce a new endpoint, say \n  GET /check/:id, that is polled every second by the client to check if the submission has been processed. \n\nIt simply looks up the submission in the database and returns the results if they are available",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uHy-G5QsoL9jKb33YADRp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6429.7416596914745,
      "y": 8794.1403035484,
      "width": 1370.68310546875,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCu",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1072937591,
      "version": 87,
      "versionNonce": 2015934647,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783252488778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Having that buffer could help you sleep at night knowing you're not going to lose any submissions, \n  even in the event of a sudden spike in traffic, retry if container fails. ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Having that buffer could help you sleep at night knowing you're not going to lose any submissions, \n  even in the event of a sudden spike in traffic, retry if container fails. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
